  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a pot over medium heat. Add the onion and carrot and cook for 5 to 6 minutes, stirring now and then, until softened.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, and turmeric and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the red lentils, vegetable stock, salt, and black pepper. Bring to a boil, then reduce to a simmer and cook for 18 to 20 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the lentils are very soft.",
    "Blend the soup partially with an immersion blender for a creamier texture, or leave it chunky if you prefer.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and parsley. Taste and adjust with more salt, pepper, or lemon if needed, then serve hot."
  ],
